    skos:scopeNote "Applies to private-sector organizations in the course of commercial activities, and to federally regulated businesses such as banks; in Québec, organizations subject to the private-sector Act (P-39.1) are exempt for activities within the province. Correspondences to Loi 25 in mappings.ttl."@en .

